WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:05.260
Surely one couldn't hurt.

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:07.140
A greedy Captain Hook is stalking the

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:11.309
streets this Halloween. As children have
fun dressing up as Peter Pan and other

00:00:11.309 --> 00:00:15.389
characters, the US sugar lobby has
their money-grubbing hooks in their

00:00:15.389 --> 00:00:19.949
candy baskets. The American Sugar Alliance
lobbies for Stalinist supply control

00:00:19.949 --> 00:00:24.150
measures through import and domestic
production quotas that keep US sugar

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:30.080
prices well above world prices. For years,
the US has paid about double the world

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:34.920
price for raw sugar, and leading
researchers have consistently estimated

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:39.800
that the sugar program costs consumers
around 3 billion dollars every year,

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:44.000
so sugar beet growers often receive an
extra 30 to 40 thousand dollars a year

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:50.520
in their trick-or-treat baskets, but the
average household loses about 25 dollars a year.

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:55.350
It would be one thing if sugar
producers were poor, but on average, farm

00:00:55.350 --> 00:00:59.280
households have substantially higher
incomes than the families who bear the

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:04.290
costs of the sugar program. Hopefully the
ticking clock is getting louder as the

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:07.540
end looms for the US sugar program.

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:10.000
Should the US continue the sugar program?

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:14.400
Let us know in our poll. Also, let us know
what other topics you would like our

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:20.189
scholars to cover in 60 seconds and be
sure to LIKE and subscribe for more

00:01:20.189 --> 00:01:24.350
research and videos from AEI.

